<section class="panel csv-picker" aria-label="Choose PAC evidence"><div class="section-label">FROM YOUR SELECTED FILE</div><h2>PAC evidence</h2><p class="muted">Choose a CSV, then a PAC. Review the reported rows beside your graph.</p><label class="csv-file-label" for="evidence-csv-file">Choose CSV<input id="evidence-csv-file" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv"></label><p id="evidence-csv-status" role="status">FEC or Mentat CSV with a committee ID column · up to 5 MB.</p><div class="evidence-toolbar"><label for="evidence-csv-committee">PAC<select id="evidence-csv-committee" disabled><option value="">Choose a CSV first</option></select></label><label for="evidence-csv-cycle">Election cycle<select id="evidence-csv-cycle" disabled><option value="">All cycles</option></select></label></div></section>
