<p class="muted">Choose a saved company, cycle and committee independently, or follow Graph. These controls filter saved evidence.</p>
<details id="evidence-config"><summary>Configure a new snapshot</summary>
<form id="evidence-form"><div class="evidence-toolbar">
<label for="evidence-company-input">Company<input id="evidence-company-input" required maxlength="250"></label>
<label for="evidence-cycles-input">Election years<input id="evidence-cycles-input" required placeholder="2024, 2026"></label>
<label for="evidence-committees-input">FEC committee IDs<input id="evidence-committees-input" required placeholder="C00000001, C00000002"></label>
</div><label for="evidence-aliases-input">Company aliases · one per line<textarea id="evidence-aliases-input" rows="3"></textarea></label>
